WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.761
Now we connect the concepts to database storage
Analytical meaning

00:00:05.774 --> 00:00:11.893
and storage type are related but they are not
identical A nominal identifier

00:00:11.919 --> 00:00:17.737
can use text UUID or an integer key A count often
uses an integer

00:00:17.764 --> 00:00:23.886
type Currency often needs exact numeric arithmetic
The

00:00:23.913 --> 00:00:28.373
design goal is to choose types and constraints that
preserve meaning and prevent invalid data

00:00:28.399 --> 00:00:33.380
where possible Module 2 develops this much more
deeply
